From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
d3drm: faces keep vertices, texture coordinates, texture and material

IDirect3DRMFace and IDirect3DRMFace2 implement AddVertex, GetVertex(ices),
GetNormal (of the plane of the first three vertices), texture coordinates and
topology, the vertex count and indices, and hold a texture and a material.
